  "reviewNotes": [
    "This artifact intentionally adds common parameters absent from MiniMed's existing small CALIPER slice; Hb/RBC/WBC/platelets are not duplicated here.",
    "Reference intervals are analyzer- and cohort-specific and must not override the performing laboratory's own verified reference interval.",
    "The source's age boundaries are preserved as strings; no boundary harmonization or interpolation is inferred.",
    "Sex partitions are retained only where the source table gives different limits for the selected parameter.",
    "Confidence intervals and sample counts are not copied into this compact research artifact; consult the source table during clinical review.",
